    "long_instructions": "##College Applications\r\n\r\nCounselor Marcus Webb has 6 applications on his desk, but only 2 spots left in this year's incoming class. \r\n\r\nUse your best judgement and rank the order of the applicants. Drag the numbers in the box to the left and place them at the top of the chart to indicate the order.\r\n\r\nFor your top student applicant, write a justification as to why you chose them.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
    "require_edit_to_continue": "true",
